### Convert React component to plain text

Source: https://github.com/resend/react-email/blob/canary/apps/docs/utilities/render.mdx

Generate a plain text version of the email for clients that do not support HTML.

```jsx
import { MyTemplate } from './email';
import { toPlainText, render } from 'react-email';

const html = await render(<MyTemplate />);
const text = toPlainText(html);

console.log(text);
```

